--[[
    IncrementalUi v4.0.0
    Clean monochrome Roblox UI library
    Usage:
        local UI = loadstring(game:HttpGet("YOUR_RAW_GITHUB_URL"))()
        local Window = UI:CreateWindow({Name = "My Hub", Accent = "White"})
        local Tab = Window:CreateTab("Main")
        local Section = Tab:CreateSection("General")
        Section:CreateButton({Name = "Example", Callback = function() print("Clicked") end})

    Notes:
    - Config persistence uses executor file functions when available.
    - Without file functions, configs remain available for the current session.
    - This is a client-side UI library, not a secure authentication system.
]]

